{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "user-cdc-end-to-end",
  "title": "User CDC | End-to-End",
  "description": "The demo dashboard: watch a CREATE/UPDATE/DELETE flow through the whole pipeline live.",
  "tags": [
    "migration-lab"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "User CDC pipeline",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 20
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "```\nMonolith\n   |\n   v\nPostgres (legacy_cdc_slot)\n   |  WAL\n   v\nDebezium (legacy-cdc-connector)\n   |\n   v\nKafka (legacy.public.users)\n   |\n   v\nuser-service-cdc consumer\n   |\n   v\nUser Service PostgreSQL\n```\nUse this dashboard to demonstrate the pipeline end to end: create/update/delete a user in the monolith and watch the numbers below move."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Events Generated (monolith writes)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_requests_total{service=\"monolith-backend\", route=\"/users\", method=~\"POST|PUT|DELETE\"}[5m]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Events Published (Debezium, JMX best-effort)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0,
